<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Village half-yr net profit A$26.1 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Village half-yr net profit A$26.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended Dec 31</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 26.10 vs  20.56</p>
<p>    Div				    nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Village Roadshow Ltd is a cinema and theme park operator.  </p>
<p>    Sales				    172.95 vs 132.24</p>
<p>    Other income			    24.71 vs  34.28</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			     13.12 vs 10.60</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		    loss 0.92 vs   nil</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date April 15</p>
<p>Reg date March 31</p>
<p>    Tax					  3.23 vs  4.83</p>
<p>    Interest				   5.87 vs  6.72</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    25.10 vs 12.16</p>
<p>    Minorities				 8.11 vs  7.36</p>
<p>NOTE: Village said the abnormal loss reflected provision for redundancies and write-off of leasehold improvements, which was partially offset by future income tax benefit.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
